    "input": "search_query: Dear Northwind Outdoor Support Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to you regarding my recent purchase of the TrailBlazer 500 bike, which I received just last week. I have been thoroughly enjoying my initial rides, and I am very pleased with the quality of the equipment. However, I am reaching out to ask if there might be any flexibility regarding the extended warranty coverage.\n\nI understand that the standard policy allows for extending coverage to five years for 15% of the original price, but only within the first 30 days of purchase. Unfortunately, due to a slight delay in my personal schedule, I am now just a few days past that 30-day window. I am not asking for a full refund or a violation of your rules, but rather a kind exception to allow me to secure this five-year extension at the 15% rate. I value your service highly and would hate to miss out on this protection because of a minor timing issue. I would be most grateful if you could review my case with some leniency. Thank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nArthur",
